563
00:44:27,064 --> 00:44:32,064
誰も気にしない貪欲に数字を追いかけた
Nobody cares, avariciously chasing after numbers.

564
00:44:32,564 --> 00:44:37,564
扉の向こうから微かに漏れる声
From the other side of the door, a voice faintly leaks.

565
00:44:38,064 --> 00:44:42,564
「仕方ない」と膝立てて部屋の隅っこで小さく罵声を吐く
Pulling my knees up saying "It can't be helped" and spitting curses in the corner of the room.

566
